WEBVTT

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:35.250
Good morning.

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:45.790
A little more.

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:50.540
Well done.

00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:51.750
So cute...

00:00:54.290 --> 00:00:57.410
Right? She's so cute, Chocola's heart throbs!

00:00:57.410 --> 00:01:00.330
Yes, she is cute, too.

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:03.540
But Chocola taking care of someone is cute.

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:06.200
What?! Chocola?!

00:02:38.370 --> 00:02:40.120
Let's eat!

00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:47.330
Hmm? Where's the new one?

00:02:47.330 --> 00:02:50.000
What? She was here just a moment ago...

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:54.660
I take my eyes off for one moment,
and she becomes so delicious...

00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:56.160
No, no...

00:02:58.250 --> 00:02:59.250
There you are!

00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:04.200
Why are you eating here?

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:06.120
Here, come out now.

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:10.580
Come, let's eat together.

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:23.660
What's this, Vanilla?

00:03:23.660 --> 00:03:25.040
Some reason or another.

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:27.870
Here you go.

00:03:28.870 --> 00:03:32.250
We're going to go help the master now.

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:34.290
You should relax and watch TV.

00:03:39.370 --> 00:03:42.080
You use it like this.

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:44.160
"Early summer at the Katase Port,
full of fresh fish!"
"Breakfast at the directly-shipped fish market!"
We are at the fish market today!

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:48.830
Look at this magnificent bonito!

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:53.330
Here, you can eat fresh fish
straight out of the ocean.

00:03:56.200 --> 00:03:59.290
Unfortunately, that's not edible.

00:03:59.290 --> 00:04:02.790
You must like bonito. Chocola loves bonito, too.

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:10.160
Oh, if we lived in the ocean,
we could eat fish all the time.

00:04:10.160 --> 00:04:11.120
Ocean...?

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:14.290
Oh, have you never seen the ocean?

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:15.910
It's awesome!

00:04:15.910 --> 00:04:19.910
It's like, huge, and salty, and cold...

00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:21.330
Anyway, it's awesome!

00:04:22.330 --> 00:04:24.080
--Chocola.
--Hmm?

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:26.450
Your explanation is completely inadequate.

00:04:26.450 --> 00:04:27.950
Huh? What?!

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:34.370
Welcome. I will take your order please.

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:38.500
First player... Rook to 2F.

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:41.950
That's an interesting move... Yes... Indeed.

00:04:41.950 --> 00:04:44.080
This is a fairly good move for what it's worth.

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:47.080
It could be followed by a Pawn to 3F.

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:50.870
I see, that's this one here.

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:53.830
Yes, and if that is followed by this...

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:16.200
Thank you for waiting.
Here is the Darjeeling you ordered.

00:05:16.200 --> 00:05:17.580
Thank you.

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:19.700
Please enjoy.

00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:27.200
The cakes here are delicious.

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:32.290
I know right? This place is my favorite.
The cats are so cute, too.

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:34.160
I might want to come back again, too.

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:39.700
Oh, I haven't seen her before.

00:05:39.700 --> 00:05:41.660
So small and cute!

00:05:41.660 --> 00:05:42.870
Oh, hey!

00:05:42.870 --> 00:05:46.200
S-Sorry, she is different!

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:54.080
Hey, you can't come out--
we have customers out here.

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:58.620
We are still working,
so go back to the room and play.

00:06:21.160 --> 00:06:22.250
Good.

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:32.910
Oh, it's you. What are you doing here?

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:35.580
Master is engaged in exotic role-playing.

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:39.120
Wh-What?! No! What are
you talking about, Vanilla!

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:40.620
What's going on?

00:06:41.910 --> 00:06:45.000
Could that be... blindfold play?!

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:49.540
Such stimulating,
perverted activities, during work...

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:50.540
H-Hey...

00:06:50.540 --> 00:06:54.700
But if Kashou-<i>san </i>did that to me suddenly...

00:06:54.700 --> 00:06:58.500
Oh, Cinnamon would become moist!

00:06:58.500 --> 00:07:01.870
Hey, watch what you're saying.
The whole shop can hear you.

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:08.370
Sorry to startle you.

00:07:08.370 --> 00:07:10.580
Here, have this cake as a token of my apology.

00:07:11.540 --> 00:07:14.200
It's called a cacao cake. It's good.

00:07:26.790 --> 00:07:28.080
She eats well.

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:30.410
Master's cakes are exquisite.

00:07:32.290 --> 00:07:34.290
It seems like you like it.

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:39.580
Master is such a cat-swindler.

00:07:50.790 --> 00:07:53.200
--Thank you for the food!
--Thank you for the food.

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:54.450
Thanks.

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:56.750
Oh, it was delicious!

00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:59.660
Well, back to work for us!

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:05.540
Oh, um...

00:08:05.540 --> 00:08:08.540
I know! Vanilla, we still
have some time, right?

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:13.160
Yes, we do. Maple and Cinnamon are here, too.

00:08:13.160 --> 00:08:16.290
Right! Then let's play for a bit!

00:08:52.910 --> 00:08:54.620
Ouch...

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:57.080
Chocola!

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:07.660
Hey, break time is over soon.

00:09:07.660 --> 00:09:09.370
--Shh...
--Huh?

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:15.580
She fell asleep.

00:09:15.580 --> 00:09:17.660
Yes, sound asleep.

00:09:30.410 --> 00:09:32.200
We're off, then!

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:33.450
Be careful.

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:34.580
Yes!

00:09:34.580 --> 00:09:36.120
Good luck to you, too.

00:09:37.160 --> 00:09:39.750
Monthly health check.

00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:44.830
We measure our height and
weight and see how big we got.

00:09:46.450 --> 00:09:49.750
Look forward to hearing
about how much we've grown.

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:52.910
Please take some time to rest, Master!

00:09:52.910 --> 00:09:57.790
Yeah, I'll make the best out of this break
and relax for a change.

00:09:57.790 --> 00:10:02.200
What?! Are you saying that we cats
are preventing you from relaxing?!

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:05.370
No, that's not what I meant...

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:07.330
--Don't worry.
--Huh?

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:11.200
Master's body can no longer
resist being apart from ours.

00:10:12.540 --> 00:10:14.700
What does that even mean?

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:22.700
Maple, 157 centimeters.

00:10:22.700 --> 00:10:26.160
May-<i>chan</i>, 157 centimeters.

00:10:26.160 --> 00:10:28.620
I guess that's about right.

00:10:28.620 --> 00:10:30.000
Next, please.

00:10:32.660 --> 00:10:35.080
Azuki is 142 centimeters.

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:37.950
"Health Notebook"
Azu-<i>chan</i>, 142 centimeters.

00:10:38.160 --> 00:10:40.450
Tiny as always, huh?

00:10:40.450 --> 00:10:42.040
What did you say?!

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:44.370
Oh, did I strike a nerve?

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:47.790
You have some nerve,
poking fun at my physique like that!

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:50.790
Okay, time to take weights now.

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:52.000
Yes.

00:10:56.500 --> 00:10:59.080
Uh-oh, I gained a bit...

00:10:59.080 --> 00:11:00.910
Nuts-<i>chan </i>is at fifty--

00:11:00.910 --> 00:11:02.950
Hey! Don't say it out loud!

00:11:02.950 --> 00:11:07.580
Life as a big eater must be hard.
Did your belly grow a bit?

00:11:07.580 --> 00:11:11.450
I'd take that over a
short-legged, tiny body any day.

00:11:11.450 --> 00:11:13.290
What did you just say?

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:15.790
Um, short legs and tiny body?

00:11:15.790 --> 00:11:17.620
What?! Do you want some of this?!

00:11:17.620 --> 00:11:20.040
Fine, but don't give up too quickly!

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:21.500
Bring it!

00:11:21.500 --> 00:11:23.700
You're going down!

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:31.000
Hey, stop it. We're measuring now.

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:32.620
--But Nuts...!
--But Azuki...!

00:11:32.620 --> 00:11:36.700
No buts! Stop now, or no snacks for you!

00:11:41.120 --> 00:11:44.750
Wow, they never grow tired of that, do they?

00:11:44.750 --> 00:11:48.790
Azu-<i>chan </i>and Nuts-<i>chan</i>
are so friendly with each other.

00:11:51.500 --> 00:11:53.330
We're home!

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:56.700
Our home is now Master's house.

00:11:56.700 --> 00:11:58.410
This is not our home, to be exact.

00:11:58.410 --> 00:12:00.120
Then what should Chocola have said?

00:12:02.540 --> 00:12:06.040
Like, "Behold" or "Ahoy"?

00:12:06.040 --> 00:12:09.120
Welcome!

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:11.500
This is your first measurement.

00:12:17.330 --> 00:12:22.540
Chocola is the same as the last time,
a fully-grown adult cat now.

00:12:24.950 --> 00:12:27.290
Chocola is 152 centimeters.

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:31.120
Okay, stand there.

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:36.950
One hundred eight centimeters.

00:12:36.950 --> 00:12:40.250
Oh, what's her name, anyway?

00:12:40.250 --> 00:12:46.700
Oh, right. We're taking her in now,
so we should give her a proper name.

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:49.160
I think we settled on "Sugarcane."

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:51.910
Azuki, you're still going with that?

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:53.450
But it's delicious.

00:12:53.450 --> 00:12:55.250
Then "Cheese!"

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:58.000
Hmm, that is delicious, too...

00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:59.950
How about Macaron?

00:12:59.950 --> 00:13:01.580
I like short cakes!

00:13:01.580 --> 00:13:02.620
Tuna.

00:13:02.620 --> 00:13:05.950
Umm... S-Sausage...?

00:13:05.950 --> 00:13:07.040
Scones.

00:13:07.040 --> 00:13:08.750
Mugwort!

00:13:08.750 --> 00:13:13.540
Stop, you're just naming
your favorite foods now.

00:13:15.290 --> 00:13:17.540
She's right.

00:13:17.540 --> 00:13:21.870
It's her name, it should
be something she likes.

00:13:21.870 --> 00:13:25.500
In that case... Dried fish.

00:13:25.500 --> 00:13:29.790
Seriously? I mean, she does seem to like it.

00:13:29.790 --> 00:13:31.700
Not cute. Overruled.

00:13:36.160 --> 00:13:37.910
Cacao cake?

00:13:37.910 --> 00:13:40.660
Oh, that sounds good!

00:13:40.660 --> 00:13:44.540
She really seemed to like
Kashou-<i>san</i>'s cacao cake.

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:45.660
Yeah!

00:13:45.660 --> 00:13:48.040
That sounds good. So...

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:51.330
Cacao... How about Cacao?

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:52.790
Cute name!

00:13:52.790 --> 00:13:54.370
I think it's great.

00:13:54.370 --> 00:13:55.790
Sounds good.

00:13:55.790 --> 00:13:58.950
I can live with that.

00:13:58.950 --> 00:14:00.830
What do you think about Cacao?

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:03.660
Yes, Cacao!

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:14.330
Cacao is 18 kilograms.

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:16.580
Cacao, 18 kilograms.

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:18.870
So small and light!

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:21.620
She might be smaller than when I was a kitten.

00:14:27.290 --> 00:14:29.790
Cacao, 53 centimeters.

00:14:29.790 --> 00:14:31.910
Fifty-three centimeters.

00:14:32.620 --> 00:14:34.950
Chocola, 75 centimeters.

00:14:34.950 --> 00:14:36.700
Seventy-five centimeters!

00:14:36.700 --> 00:14:38.660
Vanilla, 70 centimeters.

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:40.410
Seventy centimeters.

00:14:40.410 --> 00:14:44.580
Yay! Chocola beat Vanilla
in both breasts and height!

00:14:46.040 --> 00:14:49.450
I'm happy to see Chocola happy.

00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:52.080
And heavier than Vanilla, too.

00:14:52.080 --> 00:14:54.830
Please don't remind me...

00:14:56.580 --> 00:14:58.790
Cinnamon, 92 centimeters.

00:14:59.450 --> 00:15:01.830
Overwhelming mega-size.

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:03.910
Huge, as always.

00:15:03.910 --> 00:15:05.910
On par with Coconut.

00:15:07.290 --> 00:15:09.330
You've gotten bigger than the last time.

00:15:09.330 --> 00:15:11.910
Oh, really?

00:15:11.910 --> 00:15:16.120
It's okay, I like both big and small.

00:15:20.950 --> 00:15:24.750
C-C-Cacao?! What are you doing?!

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:55.700
Cacao, c-could you be...?

00:15:58.290 --> 00:16:02.200
Are you remembering your mother...?

00:16:02.200 --> 00:16:08.000
B-But... please...

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:11.120
...you have to stop!

00:16:12.870 --> 00:16:18.330
Good work, everyone. To wrap things up,
it's time to check your kinetic vision.

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:21.620
Is everyone ready?

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:22.910
Here it goes.

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:25.160
Yes!

00:16:25.160 --> 00:16:26.540
Coconut.

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:27.870
It was a mouse.

00:16:27.870 --> 00:16:30.660
Correct. One point to Coconut.

00:16:30.660 --> 00:16:33.580
--Yes!
--I guess I was a bit slow.

00:16:34.750 --> 00:16:38.660
You just have to tell what
showed up quickly on the TV.

00:16:38.660 --> 00:16:41.870
It's where we let show off our cat powers.

00:16:41.870 --> 00:16:44.000
Next question.

00:16:45.120 --> 00:16:47.790
I think I got it. A rabbit?

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:50.410
Correct. One point to Cinnamon.

00:16:50.410 --> 00:16:51.870
Yay!

00:16:51.870 --> 00:16:54.080
What's wrong, Azuki?

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:56.250
You haven't even gotten a single point yet.

00:16:56.250 --> 00:16:59.410
Shut it. I'm just warming up.

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:01.870
Okay, continuing on.

00:17:02.790 --> 00:17:04.870
--Hawk!
--Tiger!

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:06.250
Grasshopper!

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:09.000
Correct. Three points to Azuki.

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:12.080
That's how it's done.

00:17:13.160 --> 00:17:15.080
Okay, next one coming.

00:17:22.910 --> 00:17:25.830
Shigure, please don't show us that...

00:17:25.830 --> 00:17:29.500
You all need to grow up and get used to this.

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:36.540
Chocola, you have very un-cat-like vision...

00:17:36.540 --> 00:17:38.620
This last one is hard.

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:42.160
Huh...?

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:44.040
Wasn't that too fast?

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:46.450
Hmm... I don't know...

00:17:46.450 --> 00:17:49.250
Hah, I saw it.

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:51.870
It was "I really, really, really,
love Shigure-<i>sama</i>."

00:17:51.870 --> 00:17:52.870
Wrong.

00:17:52.870 --> 00:17:54.950
Huh... What?!

00:17:54.950 --> 00:18:00.830
Pay more attention. It makes
me sad that you can't see this.

00:18:05.870 --> 00:18:07.830
What's wrong, Cacao?

00:18:10.250 --> 00:18:12.540
Did you figure out the asnwer?

00:18:15.250 --> 00:18:20.660
"I really, really, really, really,
love Shigure-<i>sama.</i>"

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:21.950
Correct!

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:26.160
"I really, really, really, really,
love Shigure-<i>sama</i>"

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:28.120
She read that one?

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:29.580
Impressive.

00:18:29.580 --> 00:18:31.250
Great, Cacao!

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:33.200
One more time.

00:18:33.200 --> 00:18:35.750
Say the answer again, one more time.

00:18:40.790 --> 00:18:44.870
That's all for today's measurements!

00:18:44.870 --> 00:18:46.870
Done and done.

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:48.540
What should we do now?

00:18:48.540 --> 00:18:52.250
I saw a nice-looking shop nearby.
Wanna go check it out?

00:18:52.250 --> 00:18:54.830
It might be a good time for a walk.

00:18:54.830 --> 00:18:57.250
Chocola, you guys are still free, right?

00:18:57.250 --> 00:19:02.330
Actually, Chocola was thinking
of a place to take Cacao.

00:19:02.330 --> 00:19:03.410
What do you think?

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:05.160
A place to take Cacao?

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:06.290
Yes!

00:19:14.950 --> 00:19:17.370
Isn't this awesome, Cacao?

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:21.160
The ocean is so close.

00:19:21.160 --> 00:19:25.750
We were so surprised when
the master brought us here!

00:19:25.750 --> 00:19:28.950
First time at the ocean; it was fun.

00:19:30.200 --> 00:19:34.200
Look! Great, isn't it? The ocean!

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:36.950
Wow, a big pond!

00:19:41.500 --> 00:19:43.700
The ocean is wonderful.

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:44.870
Yes...

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:48.370
Here, over here.

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:53.910
Too early to go in.

00:19:53.910 --> 00:19:56.580
Don't worry, it's not scary!

00:19:56.580 --> 00:19:58.500
Just salty.

00:19:58.500 --> 00:20:02.950
Bonito, fatty tuna--
they're all in this big ocean.

00:20:02.950 --> 00:20:06.750
Chocola, "fatty tuna" isn't the name of a fish.

00:20:06.750 --> 00:20:08.580
--Huh?
--Huh?

00:20:08.580 --> 00:20:11.910
Wait, you didn't know either?

00:20:11.910 --> 00:20:15.700
Huh? Well... Of course I knew!

00:20:15.700 --> 00:20:18.750
Fatty tuna is the name of a part of a tuna.

00:20:18.750 --> 00:20:22.950
Yeah, that's it!
It's shaped like a V, like this!

00:20:24.120 --> 00:20:27.870
Okay, Cacao, let's play!

00:20:40.950 --> 00:20:42.120
There!

00:20:44.450 --> 00:20:46.000
Oh, no!

00:20:50.330 --> 00:20:52.830
Wow, we sure did play!

00:20:52.830 --> 00:20:55.040
I'm starving!

00:20:55.040 --> 00:20:57.660
Indeed! So hungry!

00:20:57.660 --> 00:21:00.250
I can have like ten bowls of rice now.

00:21:00.250 --> 00:21:02.500
That's way too much.

00:21:02.500 --> 00:21:04.700
Let's come back again
when it's swimming season.

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:07.450
Yeah! I'm so going to swim
a lot again this year!

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:09.540
Did you enjoy it, Cacao?

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:14.540
Next time we come,
Chocola will teach you how to swim.

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:18.370
It's not scary, once you get used to it.

00:21:18.370 --> 00:21:20.830
We should pack some lunches.

00:21:20.830 --> 00:21:23.540
Sounds good. Let's make lots.

00:21:23.540 --> 00:21:26.790
All right! Fried chicken,
rolled egg, you name it!

00:21:26.790 --> 00:21:29.290
I'll make lots of <i>inarizushi</i>.

00:21:29.290 --> 00:21:31.410
Salmon sounds good.

00:21:31.410 --> 00:21:34.830
Sausages and hamburgers!
Also grilled cheese on meat!

00:21:34.830 --> 00:21:37.290
Nuts, you eat too much meat.

00:21:37.290 --> 00:21:40.370
Strawberry cake for Chocola,
with lots of cream!

